    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama w'amahe nagamba ati, “Inywe bakuhani nimbaha omuhango ogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamutahuliire mukaguta aha mutima mukampa kitinwa, nimbataho omuraamo, n'ebyo mwinabyo mbiraame. Omu mazima nabiraamire, enshonga ebyo ndikubaragira timulikubiteka aha mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibonabonyia abaana banyu, nainywe mbasiige obushai omu maisho, obushai bw'ebitunganwa ebyo mulikumpongera, nshube mbabinge mulekere kunkolera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo mulimanya okwo mbahairekwo omuhango ogu, endagano yange n'abakuhani baijukuru ba Levi etalichweka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu ndagano yange na baijukuru ba Levi nkabaraganisa oburora n'emilembe, mara nkabibahakwo kabantina, bashuba bantinakwo, bampa ekitinwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba begesa ebilikwo mara tibagambaga kubi. Tukatura hamoi kurungi bashuba baba bulebero aha bandi nabo balekera kukora entambara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buba buragirwa bw'omukuhani kwegesa eby'amazima ahali Ruhanga, n'abantu nibaragirwa kubekwata bakabegesa, enshonga abakuhani baba ntumwa zange inye Omukama w'amahe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kyonkai inywe bakuhani mulekeire kukora kurungi. N'abantu mubegesize ebitalibyo mwabasitaza; mwachwa endagano eyo nakozire na Levi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu kambagahise mbashonaze omu bantu bona orwo mutalikukora byondikubaragira, kandi n'ebikwete aha Mateka nimugira ekigonzi omu bantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwena tuli b'eish'emoi. Ruhanga omoi niwe yatutonzire. Mbwenu aho kubaki mutalikukolerangana mazima, n'endagano eyo Ruhanga yakozire na batatenkurw'ichwe titulikugikunira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Yuda bagokeire Ruhanga bakora eihano omuli Yerusalemu na Isiraeli yona. Rwensinga y'Omukama ey'agonza bagihagaize, abashaija bashwera abanyamahangakazi abafukamira baruhanga ab'aheru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalikukora batyo Omukama asinge abachwe omw'ihanga lya Isiraeli, mara atalibajubura kumuletera bihongo eby'eihanga lyaitu limuletera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimushuba nimukora n'eki: Alutare y'Omukama mwagijobesa amalira, nimuchura nimutaga kuba takikunda bihongo byanyu na mashemelerwa; takibitora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimubaza muti, “Kubaki atalikubitora?” Talikubitora kuba namanya okwo iwe Isiraeli ogokeire mukazi wawe owo wayebohoire. Atura aba mukazi wawe, wamugokera, n'orwo waragaine omu maisho ga Ruhanga omukazi ogwo kumugilira obwesigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga omumoi tiyakujwangainyie na mukazi ogwo mukaba rugingo rumoi, mutima gumoi? Akagendeleraki kugir'atyo? Akagonza kamuzara abana abalibakwo bantube. Kityo muramanya, omuntu atagokera mukaziwe owo yayebohoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli nagamba ati, “Okutanukana kw'abali omu bushwere ninkutamwa kubi. Omuntu kukolera ati mukaziwe obukatili, ekigiro ekyo tindikukyenda n'akati. Kityo mwelinde mutagoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama mumugambire mwamulemesa. Nimushuba nimugira muti, “Twamulemesa tutai?” Nimumulemesa orwo mulikugamba muti, “Buli omoi alikukora kubi murungi aha Mukama, namushemelerwa.” Nimumulemesa orundi orwo mulikubaza muti, “Ruhanga ow'amazima ali nkahai?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
